### Select initial class equipment (replacement)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/characters/5/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipmentIds": [
    1
  ]
}

### Read canonical equipment catalog
GET http://localhost:3000/api/equipment

### Read class-linked equipment options
GET http://localhost:3000/api/characters/5/equipment/available

### Read character inventory
GET http://localhost:3000/api/characters/5/equipment

### Add equipment units
POST http://localhost:3000/api/characters/5/equipment/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 2
}

### Consume one use
POST http://localhost:3000/api/characters/5/equipment/2/use

### Remove an inventory row
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/characters/5/equipment/1
